	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0201_infomationw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いらっしゃいませ
グランドホテル　ホドモエです▼
あいにく　まんしつで　ございますが
ごゆるりと　くつろいで　くださいませ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-04T12:05:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-04T11:59:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いらっしゃいませ
グランドホテル　ホドモエです▼
あいにく　満室で　ございますが
ごゆるりと　くつろいで　くださいませ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-04T12:05:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-04T11:59:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・GRIDX＝7、GRIDZ＝2
・swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-04T12:05:05" />
		</CommentCell>
