	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0201_oldman1_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かいがらのすずを　みにつけた
ポケモンは　たたかいで▽
あいてに　ダメージを　あたえると▼
ちょびっと　たいりょくが
かいふく　するんじゃよ！▼
それよりも　おまえさん
その　ポケモンずかん　は▽
はかせに　みせておるのかい？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>かいがらのすずを　身につけた
ポケモンは　戦いで▽
相手に　ダメージを　与えると▼
ちょびっと　体力が
回復するんじゃよ！▼
それよりも　おまえさん
その　ポケモン図鑑は▽
博士に　みせておるのかい？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アイテム入手後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLDMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T08:51:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0201_breederw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じぶんより　つよい　ポケモンと
たたかうほうが　いつもより▽
たくさんの　けいけんを　えられるよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-08T05:45:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-08T05:37:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>自分より　強い　ポケモンと
戦うほうが　いつもより▽
たくさんの　経験を　得られるよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-08T05:45:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-08T05:38:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-08T05:36:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BREEDERW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-08T05:36:48" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T08:51:20" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0201_assistantw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>これって　しってた？
「ポケモンのとも」の　きじだけど▼
「ポケモンしょうぶの　とき
　Ｌボタンを　おしながら▼
　わざを　えらぶと
　くわしい　せつめいが　よめる！」</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-08T05:44:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-08T05:39:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これって　知ってた？
「ポケモンのとも」の　記事だけど▼
「ポケモン勝負の　とき
　Ｌボタンを　押しながら▼
　技を　選ぶと
　くわしい　説明が　読める！」</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-08T05:45:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-08T05:44:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-08T03:37:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ASSISTANTW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-08T03:37:35" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T08:51:24" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
